        tldr: 'Yes, your gut microbiome influences weight — but no single "skinny bacterium" exists. The 2025–2026 evidence points to alpha diversity (variety of species) as the more reliable marker, and the most actionable lever is eating 30 different fiber sources per week — not a stool test.',
